                    coach_r4_confidence:    `“I won't be wrong” is conviction, not a plan. The board is asking what happens IF you're wrong — answer with the cap, not your certainty.`,
                    coach_r4_hedge:         `“We kept enough spread that no bet can hurt us” is the four-way maybe again — and a spread that can't hurt you also can't win. Bound the downside with kill-criteria, don't dilute the bet.`,

